@startuml
title Independent work around an open decision

actor Owner
participant Supervisor
participant Scheduler
database Ledger
participant "Run clone" as Clone
participant "Claude Code host" as Host
participant "Local notification" as Banner

note over Scheduler : items B, C and A; C depends on B; B is declared first

== Item B stops to ask ==
Supervisor -> Scheduler : what next?
Scheduler --> Supervisor : start B
Supervisor -> Host : unit for B
Host --> Supervisor : ends with a question and numbered choices
Supervisor -> Clone : classify from measured facts: paused
Supervisor -> Ledger : park step started, with what the decision will say
Supervisor -> Clone : delta of B kept under a ref, tree back to the base
Supervisor -> Ledger : decision opened, affecting B and C
Supervisor -> Ledger : attempt ends blocked, one notice queued
Supervisor -> Ledger : item B blocked_on_decision

== The run goes on ==
Supervisor -> Scheduler : what next?
note over Scheduler : B is blocked, C waits behind B,\nA depends on nothing that is open
Scheduler --> Supervisor : start A
Supervisor -> Ledger : run running to running, next action the pack of A
Supervisor -> Host : unit for A
Host --> Supervisor : result
Supervisor -> Ledger : gates, then commit of A on the base content
note over Clone : nothing of B is in A's tree or commit
alt batch window has passed and not in quiet hours
  Supervisor -> Banner : one banner for the queued notices
  note over Banner : up to three tries, 0, 10 and 60 seconds;\nthe outcome never changes the run
else quiet hours
  Supervisor -> Ledger : notice held for the next digest
else window still open
  note over Supervisor : the notice stays queued
end

== Nothing left that can run ==
Supervisor -> Scheduler : what next?
note over Scheduler : B is blocked, C waits behind B,\nA is done, a decision is open
Scheduler --> Supervisor : blocked
Supervisor -> Ledger : run blocked_on_decision, reason decision,\nopen decisions named
Supervisor -> Ledger : release the lease
Supervisor -> Ledger : read items and decisions again
alt an answer arrived in that window
  Supervisor -> Ledger : run goes on in this process
else none
  Supervisor -> Banner : one banner covering every queued notice
  Supervisor --> Owner : exit; status and inbox list the decision
end
note over Owner, Ledger : an answer later starts a supervisor again:\nsee the decide and resume flow

== Other endings ==
alt every item is done
  Supervisor -> Ledger : run moves to verifying
else a decision was withdrawn and nothing else can run
  Supervisor -> Ledger : run failed, undelivered items and withdrawn decisions named
end
@enduml
